            </note>
            <note corresp="#d130-f2" n="2" xml:id="d130-f2-content">
                <p>Walter P. McConaughy, American Consul General at Shanghai.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d130-f3" n="3" xml:id="d130-f3-content">
                <p>Chairman of the East China Military and Political Council, Political Commissar of
                    the East China Military District and Political Commissar of the Third Field
                    Army.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d130-f4" n="4" xml:id="d130-f4-content">
                <p>Chairman of the Committee on Finance and Economics, People’s Republic of
                    China.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
